どちらかというと、強い坂口に寄りかかっている感じ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22725","sourceWorkId":"2702","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"シリーズを通して登場している坂口付きの看護婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"坂口に弱みを握られ脅されて言いなりになっているが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の意思だけはしっかり持っていて坂口に対して隷属していない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ自分の全てを知る相手として坂口を精神的な拠り所にしている節がある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"146922"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d7a619f6672c76cf9fab17f5a2a4016e2360407c7a8245e6334f21464ea2b352.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/4407488b463fb50931c4782c80ee4fcd593e0c0d76e964d97a19fcf57ce12b7f.webp","width":166,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高野 直子","creatorId":"vndb:s14","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14","name":"高野 直子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:22438","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c104000","characterName":"本庄 萌恵","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c104000"},"originalCharacterName":"本庄 萌恵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"827"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"47"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a nurse at Jomiya General Hospital. She is a bespect